# {{ agents.store_name }}

> 24/7 Restaurant Equipment is a full-service commercial restaurant equipment dealer based in New Jersey, selling 100+ foodservice brands online at {{ agents.store_url }}. We help restaurants, pizzerias, bakeries, bars, hotels, schools and institutional kitchens specify, buy, install and service commercial kitchen equipment: combi ovens, ranges, fryers, pizza ovens, refrigeration, ice machines, food prep equipment, vacuum sealers, stainless steel fabrication and more.

24/7 Restaurant Equipment has been in business for 30+ years and has equipped 5,000+ kitchens. Beyond online equipment sales, we provide equipment consultation and specification, delivery, removal and disposal of existing equipment, factory-authorized installation, certified start-up for warranty activation, and ongoing repair and maintenance service.

